  "content": "<div>Wordpress 主题检测工具，月访问量28万 <a href=\"https://www.wpthemedetector.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wpthemedetector.com/</a></div>\n<div>工具+内容获取流量 收录了很多主题 热门主题榜： <a href=\"https://www.wpthemedetector.com/top-wordpress-themes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wpthemedetector.com/top-wordpress-themes/</a> 热门插件榜：<a href=\"https://www.wpthemedetector.com/top-wordpress-plugins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wpthemedetector.com/top-wordpress-plugins/</a> 热门开发者榜： <a href=\"https://www.wpthemedetector.com/top-theme-providers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wpthemedetector.com/top-theme-providers/</a></div>\n<div>可以认为是 wordpress 届的 builtwith</div>\n<div>盈利方式之一是 aff ，部分付费主题可以拿到佣金</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6odlzkibcg_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这类网站不止一家</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6odlzkibcg_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>主要流量来源靠搜索</div>\n<div>调用 <a href=\"https://replicate.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://replicate.com/</a> 接口</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/6odlzkibcg_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
